While Ry reiterated well-responsive North Korea's grievances regarding Washington's resistance to the possibility of a "gradual" denuclearization approach, according to which North Correspondence will be rewarded as it gradually proceeds with the process, his statement was significant that he did not completely rule denuclearization, as Pyongyang did in the past.
